OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with rain at times first
OL,6,Fthing during the morning. The rain and
OL,7,Fcloud clear east, leaving the the rest
OL,8,Fof the day dry with sunny spells.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FDry to start the evening.
OL,11,FCloud and outbreaks of rain spread
OL,12,Fnorth into Orkney before midnight,
OL,13,Fcontinuing north to affect Shetland
OL,14,Fovernight.
OL,15,
OL,16,CWednesday:FCloudy with some outbreaks
OL,17,Fof rain at first, this clearing
OL,18,Fthrough the morning. Then bright or
OL,19,Fsunny spells and a few showers,
OL,20,Fbecoming dry in the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
