OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,6,Fwith bright spells Thursday morning. A
OL,7,Fband of cloud and rain pushes east
OL,8,FThursday evening, clearing by Friday
OL,9,Fmorning. Bright spells and some
OL,10,Fshowers Friday afternoon and Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
